  ["Rates", "Containers per minute at current and planned peak speed, and minimum stable speed for startup."],
  ["Infeed condition", "How containers arrive (touching, back-pressured, or spaced) and the conveyor width, height, and belt type feeding the screw."],
  ["Screw configuration", "Single or dual screw, number of starts, and any turning, grouping, or orienting the screw must do."],
  ["Change parts list", "Which parts are container-specific: screw, infeed and outfeed star wheels, center guide, guide rails, and dead plates."],
  ["Changeover target", "Target changeover time, tool-less or tooled, number of operators, and how parts are located and verified."],
  ["Drive and sync", "Mechanical gearing or servo, master encoder source, and controls platform for cam profiles and recipes."],
